WEBVTT

01:30.300 --> 01:31.620
[Blood River]

01:31.620 --> 01:33.980
[Based on the novel of the same name from Zhou Munan's Youth in Jianghu series]

01:33.980 --> 01:35.980
[Available on fanqienovel.com & bkneng.com]

01:36.780 --> 01:38.980
[Episode 2]

01:50.760 --> 01:51.900
That speech just now was meant

01:51.920 --> 01:52.540
for the man outside.

01:54.280 --> 01:54.930
Now, Su Muyu,

01:56.350 --> 01:57.980
shall we carry out our plan?

01:58.510 --> 01:59.180
Changhe,

02:00.640 --> 02:01.930
I cannot betray the Patriarch.

02:02.920 --> 02:03.490
Foolish.

02:04.040 --> 02:05.770
This time, the Three Families are resolved to rebel.

02:06.400 --> 02:07.260
I will pave the way for you.

02:08.240 --> 02:09.170
You only need to be ready

02:09.400 --> 02:10.410
to seize the Dormant Dragon Sword.

02:13.800 --> 02:14.570
After so many years,

02:14.630 --> 02:15.610
haven't you learned the truth?

02:18.150 --> 02:19.410
You are always so innocent.

02:20.840 --> 02:22.130
Both you and I are indebted

02:23.240 --> 02:24.220
to the Patriarch.

02:25.910 --> 02:26.540
Indebted?

02:28.150 --> 02:28.940
They trained us

02:28.960 --> 02:30.540
so we could do their killing for them.

02:31.430 --> 02:32.290
We owe them

02:32.310 --> 02:33.410
nothing.

02:44.520 --> 02:45.690
Only you truly believe

02:47.750 --> 02:48.610
that Blood River

02:48.680 --> 02:49.780
is your home.

02:59.840 --> 03:00.450
I can never

03:00.470 --> 03:01.500
make myself believe so.

03:04.590 --> 03:05.500
To me,

03:06.910 --> 03:07.610
this organization

03:07.680 --> 03:09.130
is merely a place to trade favors.

03:10.190 --> 03:11.130
He gives us shelter,

03:11.310 --> 03:12.410
and we kill for him.

03:13.400 --> 03:14.380
The talk of family

03:15.030 --> 03:16.290
is but hollow words.

03:17.680 --> 03:18.380
Su Muyu,

03:19.870 --> 03:21.340
Uncle Zhe is right outside.

03:22.240 --> 03:23.100
If we strike at you together,

03:23.150 --> 03:24.450
do you think you can survive?

03:25.520 --> 03:26.690
If Uncle Zhe joins forces with you,

03:27.910 --> 03:28.940
I am no match.

03:33.030 --> 03:34.340
But one must try.

03:39.240 --> 03:40.100
If I could talk sense into you,

03:40.150 --> 03:41.220
you wouldn't be Su Muyu.

03:43.280 --> 03:44.260
How foolish of me

03:46.120 --> 03:48.170
to waste so many words on you.

03:53.430 --> 03:54.060
Mu Bai,

03:55.190 --> 03:56.820
do you enjoy eavesdropping in there?

03:57.520 --> 03:59.060
[Mu Bai of the Mu family]
How did you know I was here?

03:59.680 --> 04:00.290
Because I was the one

04:00.310 --> 04:01.730
who sent you the message

04:02.080 --> 04:03.170
telling you to wait here.

04:06.280 --> 04:07.940
We are of the same clan.

04:08.190 --> 04:09.690
We should share what we know.

04:09.910 --> 04:11.220
Nonsense!

04:11.910 --> 04:12.730
Su Changhe,

04:13.800 --> 04:14.690
just you wait!

04:25.240 --> 04:25.900
Changhe.

04:43.390 --> 04:44.660
Once the bow is drawn, the shot must fly.

04:45.680 --> 04:47.020
The Patriarch must die this time,

04:48.390 --> 04:49.980
and I will seize the Dormant Dragon Sword.

04:52.160 --> 04:52.700
So,

04:56.240 --> 04:56.850
think carefully

04:56.870 --> 04:57.930
about the pact we once made.

04:59.800 --> 05:00.730
Su Muyu,

05:01.480 --> 05:02.540
[Four years ago]
you shall become Blood River's Kui,

05:02.560 --> 05:03.410
rise as the Patriarch,

05:03.430 --> 05:04.410
and command the Three Families.

05:05.480 --> 05:06.810
I shall remain with the Su family

05:07.360 --> 05:08.900
and inherit its headship.

05:23.560 --> 05:24.900
This carriage is quite something.

05:25.680 --> 05:26.540
It's so large,

05:26.720 --> 05:27.780
yet it moves so smoothly.

05:28.390 --> 05:29.340
It's so heavy,

05:29.510 --> 05:30.660
yet it travels 100 li a day.

05:32.680 --> 05:34.780
It is the work

05:35.310 --> 05:36.410
of the Ban family's third master.

05:37.070 --> 05:38.250
Of course it is impressive.

05:38.800 --> 05:39.730
He died

05:39.750 --> 05:40.700
ten days

05:41.070 --> 05:41.900
after finishing it.

05:45.240 --> 05:46.140
He fell ill and passed.

05:50.920 --> 05:52.700
If I cure you, Sir,

05:53.630 --> 05:55.610
will I also "die of illness" myself?

05:59.510 --> 06:00.610
You worry too much.

06:01.310 --> 06:02.730
You are a miracle physician.

06:09.000 --> 06:11.540
The Blood River upheaval has begun.

06:12.070 --> 06:13.170
Within ten days,

06:14.000 --> 06:16.290
we shall see an outcome.

06:17.190 --> 06:18.370
Let the waters of Blood River

06:19.070 --> 06:20.660
spread across the martial world

06:21.600 --> 06:22.850
and surge into Tianqi.

06:24.680 --> 06:25.340
Changhe,

06:26.190 --> 06:27.100
perhaps this time,

06:27.750 --> 06:28.660
we will really draw blades

06:28.750 --> 06:29.780
against each other.

06:50.380 --> 06:52.580
[Fifteen years ago]

07:13.000 --> 07:15.900
[Young Su Changhe]

07:17.750 --> 07:18.540
Over the years,

07:19.680 --> 07:20.930
of all the Lamp Children,

07:21.830 --> 07:22.850
he is the only one

07:24.510 --> 07:26.460
to survive a mission.

07:27.560 --> 07:28.810
Shall we bring him back?

07:32.390 --> 07:33.020
No need.

07:43.120 --> 07:44.290
This is the end for me.

07:45.160 --> 07:46.290
No. 17,

07:47.070 --> 07:48.370
I owed you a hand.

07:50.000 --> 07:51.370
Now I'm repaying it with my life.

07:52.510 --> 07:53.780
It seems you got the better deal.

07:57.000 --> 08:04.040
♪How many hidden feelings sink in silence deep?♪

08:06.280 --> 08:12.360
♪Searching through the endless nights, struggling on the edge...♪

08:12.360 --> 08:13.490
No. 17,

08:14.240 --> 08:15.490
what are you doing here?

08:15.510 --> 08:16.810
I overheard your mission location

08:16.920 --> 08:18.050
and ran off to find you.

08:18.190 --> 08:19.220
Let me take you home.

08:22.070 --> 08:22.930
Can that place

08:25.190 --> 08:26.660
be called a home?

08:27.800 --> 08:29.580
A home is where family waits.

08:29.580 --> 08:31.190
[Young Su Muyu]

08:31.190 --> 08:32.340
Your younger brother is still there.

08:34.360 --> 08:37.840
♪Like fate, winding with the tide♪

08:37.880 --> 08:42.880
♪Who can ford this river of night?♪

08:43.960 --> 08:46.480
♪Where's the far shore...♪

08:46.480 --> 08:47.220
So am I.

08:47.660 --> 08:52.620
♪Surrendering all hues for a glimmer of light♪

08:53.500 --> 08:59.020
♪Through joy and sorrow, still I can't let go♪

08:59.300 --> 09:02.420
♪Longing keeps me awake at night♪

09:02.860 --> 09:11.260
♪My heart no longer my own. No one can escape from love♪

09:11.550 --> 09:12.300
Why do you always

09:12.320 --> 09:13.370
make such a mess of yourself?

09:16.910 --> 09:17.700
You always

09:17.720 --> 09:19.010
turn up in time anyway,

09:19.960 --> 09:20.890
so a little mess

09:22.790 --> 09:23.890
doesn't matter.

09:28.270 --> 09:29.060
The trial at the Wailing Abyss

09:29.150 --> 09:30.060
begins soon.

09:30.910 --> 09:32.130
The family heads have summoned us home.

09:33.840 --> 09:34.650
This day

09:36.200 --> 09:37.300
has come at last.

09:38.180 --> 09:41.840
♪Where's the far shore we chase all our lives?♪

09:41.840 --> 09:46.340
♪Surrendering all hues for a glimmer of light♪

09:59.000 --> 10:00.610
I believe you already know how this works.

10:01.390 --> 10:02.580
When the hour strikes,

10:03.200 --> 10:04.820
you will head for the Wailing Abyss.

10:06.360 --> 10:07.300
Each group has ten people,

10:08.150 --> 10:09.580
and only one will make it out alive.

10:10.260 --> 10:10.960
[Sixty-Three]

10:10.960 --> 10:11.490
Group one:

10:12.720 --> 10:13.530
No. 86,

10:17.630 --> 10:18.420
No. 18,

10:22.360 --> 10:23.130
No. 74,

10:25.390 --> 10:26.180
No. 42,

10:27.480 --> 10:28.340
No. 34,

10:29.790 --> 10:30.940
No. 26,

10:31.180 --> 10:33.340
[Seventeen]

10:34.240 --> 10:35.300
and No. 17.

10:49.200 --> 10:50.850
The last of group one:

10:52.150 --> 10:53.490
No. 63.

10:57.600 --> 10:58.940
No. 63!

11:35.870 --> 11:37.060
Who has offended you, Muqiu?

11:37.510 --> 11:38.420
You seem very upset.

11:38.720 --> 11:39.770
Mu Zizhe,

11:40.720 --> 11:41.610
you know full well

11:41.630 --> 11:42.820
we have our eye on those two.

11:43.440 --> 11:44.460
Are you trying

11:45.320 --> 11:46.890
to make the Su family your enemy?

11:47.480 --> 11:48.980
Don't make such a big accusation.

11:49.240 --> 11:49.980
I wouldn't dare.

11:50.550 --> 11:51.370
I was only doing my duty

11:51.390 --> 11:52.770
as the chief instructor.

11:53.030 --> 11:53.700
Duty?

11:54.790 --> 11:55.850
Not placing two strong fighters

11:55.870 --> 11:56.770
in the same group

11:57.080 --> 11:58.370
is an unwritten rule among the Three Families.

11:59.390 --> 12:00.370
Aren't you afraid I will

12:01.120 --> 12:02.460
report this to the Soul Reapers' Hall?

12:04.510 --> 12:05.770
Let them grow close

12:06.720 --> 12:08.610
and see each other as brothers.

12:09.720 --> 12:11.180
Then set them to slaughter each other.

12:23.120 --> 12:23.940
Stay close to me.

12:24.600 --> 12:25.300
Don't stray away.

12:27.240 --> 12:27.890
I don't think

12:28.120 --> 12:29.420
I could even if I tried.

12:57.120 --> 12:57.770
They're all here.

13:10.550 --> 13:12.250
Everyone knows your swordsmanship is supreme.

13:13.000 --> 13:13.820
Rather than fight you

13:13.870 --> 13:15.130
one-on-one,

13:15.630 --> 13:16.490
we will join forces

13:16.550 --> 13:17.460
to kill you both first.

13:18.630 --> 13:19.770
Then we'll fight among ourselves

13:20.200 --> 13:21.370
for a chance to live.

13:24.120 --> 13:24.850
Then let's fight.

13:31.960 --> 13:32.490
Eightfold Trap Formation.

13:33.360 --> 13:34.250
Combining knives and swords

13:34.510 --> 13:35.220
in both offense and defense,

13:35.630 --> 13:36.650
it cuts off every chance of escape.

13:37.320 --> 13:38.060
To break this formation,

13:38.870 --> 13:39.580
there is only one way:

13:40.480 --> 13:41.340
lure them in with bait.

13:42.120 --> 13:42.820
I will be the bait!

14:16.790 --> 14:17.610
To break the formation,

14:18.240 --> 14:18.940
one must be sacrificed

14:18.960 --> 14:20.100
to find the point of escape.

14:21.270 --> 14:22.130
What's the point of us

14:22.320 --> 14:22.940
striking together?

14:23.630 --> 14:24.250
I know.

14:25.960 --> 14:26.420
Let me do it!

14:29.120 --> 14:29.820
Madman.

14:30.960 --> 14:31.650
Then I'm leaving!

14:32.680 --> 14:39.280
♪I look back to see peaks in clouds. I close my eyes and the scene comes alive♪

14:39.670 --> 14:40.490
The weak point!

14:43.840 --> 14:46.840
♪I burst into the world, and the realm is forever changed♪

14:46.960 --> 14:49.160
♪As dawn breaks in the east, I rise by my own strength♪

14:49.240 --> 14:54.160
♪The path lies beneath my feet. I seek no roots♪

14:54.280 --> 14:57.640
♪In this borrowed life, I neither love nor hate♪

14:57.800 --> 15:01.560
♪I cross the wide river with a leap of faith♪

15:01.680 --> 15:05.160
♪My eyes filled with tears♪

15:05.360 --> 15:08.560
♪Against the current, I glimpse my reflection♪

15:08.640 --> 15:14.800
♪Forget who I am, for I am part of us all♪

15:19.560 --> 15:22.080
♪Mountains dance in silver grace, but every season heroes rise in the jianghu♪

15:22.120 --> 15:23.400
♪In my chest, the torrents never cease to surge♪

15:23.440 --> 15:24.320
♪No matter the age, I rise with the wind♪

15:24.320 --> 15:26.040
♪Though born a common man, I reach for the sky♪

15:26.040 --> 15:28.200
♪The river on my back shimmers with waves of endless weight♪

15:28.200 --> 15:31.200
♪Through mud and sand, I carry the great river for thousands of li♪

15:31.240 --> 15:35.840
♪Swords gleam as the common man cries to the heavens♪

15:35.880 --> 15:38.720
♪Cultivation is like walking on thin ice. Who dares to sigh?♪

15:38.840 --> 15:44.200
♪From darkness comes the gift of light. I walk unafraid across the barren land♪

16:46.080 --> 16:47.130
Only the two of us remain.

16:51.790 --> 16:52.700
So...

16:59.150 --> 16:59.980
Are you insane?

17:03.270 --> 17:04.140
You lunatic,

17:04.750 --> 17:05.380
stop it!

17:06.400 --> 17:07.290
I told you

17:08.590 --> 17:09.420
I would repay

17:10.440 --> 17:11.860
the debt I owe you someday.

17:14.070 --> 17:15.180
I don't need your repayment.

17:16.480 --> 17:17.180
When you took my place

17:17.200 --> 17:18.330
as a Lamp Child,

17:18.350 --> 17:19.380
you already repaid me.

17:23.030 --> 17:24.290
Blood River has its rules.

17:24.830 --> 17:25.900
In each group of ten, only one

17:25.920 --> 17:26.940
walks out of the Wailing Abyss

17:27.270 --> 17:28.490
and joins one of the Three Families.

17:29.200 --> 17:30.330
If you don't take this favor,

17:31.790 --> 17:33.460
we will both die!

17:33.920 --> 17:35.010
There must be another way.

17:36.070 --> 17:37.090
I'll talk to them.

17:38.270 --> 17:39.810
They want the finest assassins,

17:41.030 --> 17:41.900
and the two of us

17:42.510 --> 17:43.730
are the best

17:43.830 --> 17:45.010
they've found in years.

17:45.830 --> 17:46.420
They would never

17:46.480 --> 17:47.700
want to lose us both.

17:52.160 --> 17:52.660
You...

17:53.680 --> 17:54.700
you're too naive.

18:05.160 --> 18:06.810
Let go!

18:16.720 --> 18:18.460
Let go!

18:20.270 --> 18:21.420
Those who are strong enough

18:22.920 --> 18:24.140
have the right to be naive.

19:16.310 --> 19:16.900
You're awake?

19:23.480 --> 19:25.420
I had a long, long dream

19:25.920 --> 19:28.620
about things from long ago.

19:59.790 --> 20:01.140
Fiends and heretics,

20:02.310 --> 20:03.900
keep away from me.

20:04.110 --> 20:06.220
- If we are the fiends and heretics... - If we are the fiends and heretics...

20:06.400 --> 20:07.770
- Is Blood River... - Is Blood River...

20:07.790 --> 20:09.660
- Righteous? - Righteous?

20:10.790 --> 20:12.570
You are but demonic illusions.

20:13.440 --> 20:15.570
I will slay you at one stroke!

20:21.880 --> 20:35.050
- Give us back our lives! - Give us back our lives!

20:37.830 --> 20:38.290
Oh, no.

20:45.030 --> 20:45.660
Sir...

20:53.310 --> 20:54.380
When a person is weak,

20:54.590 --> 20:56.050
evil finds a way

20:56.160 --> 20:57.010
to seep in.

20:57.110 --> 20:58.420
Nightmares are normal.

20:59.070 --> 20:59.570
Sir,

20:59.750 --> 21:00.490
you need not worry.

21:04.720 --> 21:05.860
Sir, are you well?

21:15.510 --> 21:16.220
Rabbit.

21:20.790 --> 21:21.180
Yes.

21:25.200 --> 21:26.220
Miss Bai,

21:29.000 --> 21:30.050
how many lives

21:32.510 --> 21:33.460
have you saved in your life?

21:37.110 --> 21:38.220
Well...

21:40.070 --> 21:41.490
I never kept count.

21:47.480 --> 21:49.250
Including Second Master Tang,

21:50.200 --> 21:51.090
I

21:51.440 --> 21:52.180
have slain

21:53.110 --> 21:55.050
832 people.

21:56.240 --> 21:57.460
I've forgotten

21:58.550 --> 22:00.460
many of their faces,

22:01.400 --> 22:02.420
but a voice

22:02.550 --> 22:04.180
always tells me

22:05.720 --> 22:07.330
those are the ones I killed.

22:11.350 --> 22:12.980
I was never afraid of such dreams.

22:15.790 --> 22:17.490
When those people appeared,

22:18.480 --> 22:20.420
I'd take my sword

22:21.000 --> 22:23.380
and cut them all to pieces.

22:24.350 --> 22:27.700
I killed them once,

22:30.110 --> 22:31.010
so of course

22:31.200 --> 22:33.460
I could kill them twice

22:34.070 --> 22:35.050
and thrice,

22:36.030 --> 22:38.860
whether in dreams

22:39.960 --> 22:41.770
or in reality.

22:46.030 --> 22:47.090
But just now,

22:47.920 --> 22:49.220
when I drew my sword,

22:50.550 --> 22:51.770
I saw that it had

22:53.000 --> 22:53.860
already broken.

22:57.440 --> 22:58.730
I want Muyu

23:00.680 --> 23:01.620
by my side at once.

23:02.720 --> 23:05.380
Aren't you worried

23:06.160 --> 23:07.180
he might

23:08.790 --> 23:09.530
betray you now?

23:11.310 --> 23:11.980
He won't.

23:34.640 --> 23:36.090
After sitting in the carriage for so long,

23:37.070 --> 23:38.010
I'm truly tired.

23:39.960 --> 23:40.810
Changhe,

23:41.160 --> 23:42.700
in this state, can you really catch up to them?

23:43.960 --> 23:45.250
What's your plan really?

23:45.790 --> 23:46.940
I will catch up.

23:47.590 --> 23:49.090
The Patriarch went north

23:49.200 --> 23:50.700
only to buy time.

23:50.790 --> 23:51.940
Knowing what he's like,

23:53.440 --> 23:54.570
I can't be sure if the Old Man

23:54.590 --> 23:55.250
will be safe,

23:55.720 --> 23:57.140
but he will surely move

23:57.590 --> 23:58.620
to wipe out us errand boys.

23:59.110 --> 24:00.010
So as far as I'm concerned,

24:00.960 --> 24:02.620
the Patriarch must die.

24:04.110 --> 24:04.730
And?

24:08.270 --> 24:09.700
My arrangements for Su Muyu

24:09.750 --> 24:10.570
should be in place.

24:10.960 --> 24:12.090
He will run into a few old acquaintances

24:12.640 --> 24:13.490
so he won't

24:13.720 --> 24:15.050
catch up to the Patriarch so soon.

24:19.620 --> 24:20.200
Hyah!

24:20.470 --> 24:21.020
Hyah!

24:25.000 --> 24:25.500
Hyah!

24:32.540 --> 24:34.420
[Su Changli of the Su family]

24:34.790 --> 24:35.420
Changli?

24:36.160 --> 24:36.530
Yu,

24:37.200 --> 24:37.900
long time no see.

24:38.510 --> 24:39.420
Did Changhe send you?

24:41.200 --> 24:42.460
Yes, he did.

24:43.240 --> 24:44.530
He told me to stop you,

24:44.790 --> 24:45.490
and if all else fails,

24:46.200 --> 24:47.140
to cry until you relent.

24:48.590 --> 24:49.460
Does he think

24:49.960 --> 24:50.860
I won't kill you?

24:53.440 --> 24:54.010
I...

24:54.240 --> 24:55.980
He thinks he can read my mind,

24:57.030 --> 24:58.220
but I have killed so many

25:00.000 --> 25:01.220
that there are times I can't

25:01.240 --> 25:02.490
hold back the urge to kill.

25:09.960 --> 25:10.770
If I'd wanted to kill you,

25:11.750 --> 25:12.530
you'd already be dead.

25:12.830 --> 25:13.460
Hyah!

25:16.030 --> 25:16.490
Yu!

25:36.660 --> 25:38.300
[Su Zhi of the Su family]

25:55.790 --> 25:56.290
Teacher.

25:57.400 --> 25:59.380
You flatter me. I'm hardly worthy

25:59.960 --> 26:01.090
of being called "teacher"

26:01.830 --> 26:02.940
by you.

26:03.830 --> 26:04.770
Mr. Su Zhi.

26:05.880 --> 26:07.050
It's been a long time,

26:07.880 --> 26:08.770
Su Muyu.

26:09.000 --> 26:10.180
So Changhe even got you involved

26:11.350 --> 26:12.700
just to stop me.

26:13.200 --> 26:14.180
Don't blame him.

26:14.920 --> 26:16.140
I came of my own will.

26:16.880 --> 26:18.050
After this,

26:18.790 --> 26:19.730
we might never

26:19.790 --> 26:20.900
meet again,

26:21.830 --> 26:23.570
so I volunteered to see you once more

26:25.270 --> 26:25.980
and play

26:26.790 --> 26:27.620
a game of weiqi with you.

26:30.200 --> 26:31.420
I'm heading somewhere. I don't have time.

26:32.160 --> 26:33.290
If there's another chance to see you,

26:33.960 --> 26:34.620
I will visit the library

26:35.350 --> 26:36.620
once I return to Blood River.

26:37.750 --> 26:38.770
If I fail

26:38.960 --> 26:40.330
to make you finish this game,

26:41.200 --> 26:42.380
Changhe may

26:44.680 --> 26:45.420
kill me.

27:08.000 --> 27:08.940
Did you come

27:09.880 --> 27:11.490
to persuade me to join forces with Changhe?

27:13.270 --> 27:14.860
The two of you are the most remarkable pair

27:15.030 --> 27:16.530
Blood River has seen in the past century.

27:16.960 --> 27:18.770
You've overcome countless crises together.

27:20.030 --> 27:20.570
I believe

27:21.480 --> 27:22.050
you can

27:22.110 --> 27:23.180
do it again this time.

27:24.310 --> 27:25.250
I heard from Changhe

27:26.000 --> 27:26.660
that you

27:26.680 --> 27:27.660
made a pact four years ago

27:28.680 --> 27:30.180
that he'd become head of the Su family,

27:31.070 --> 27:32.460
and you'd rise as the Patriarch,

27:33.880 --> 27:35.860
the new master of Blood River.

27:38.640 --> 27:39.730
Then did he tell you

27:40.960 --> 27:42.380
that I never agreed to that pact?

27:46.750 --> 27:47.900
Does the Patriarch

27:48.750 --> 27:49.980
truly deserve such loyalty from you?

27:52.960 --> 27:54.220
Does the answer to that question matter?

27:58.350 --> 27:58.860
Muyu,

27:59.720 --> 28:00.940
when you answer

28:00.960 --> 28:01.380
a question

28:01.400 --> 28:02.490
with another question,

28:03.480 --> 28:04.660
it means you haven't

28:05.510 --> 28:06.330
made up your mind.

28:07.310 --> 28:08.330
But some questions have no right answer,

28:09.480 --> 28:10.090
only choices to make.

28:10.920 --> 28:12.490
I've stayed with the Su family for nearly a decade.

28:13.240 --> 28:14.050
Changhe and I

28:14.590 --> 28:16.140
emerged from the same Furnace

28:16.200 --> 28:17.330
as martial brothers.

28:18.480 --> 28:19.290
To be precise,

28:20.830 --> 28:21.810
we are all family.

28:26.270 --> 28:27.570
A man like Changhe

28:28.270 --> 28:29.570
would never consider the family head

28:29.680 --> 28:30.570
his family.

28:31.480 --> 28:32.290
He only

28:34.720 --> 28:36.180
sees you as family.

28:38.070 --> 28:39.220
But now I am the Kui.

28:41.830 --> 28:42.980
My father once told me

28:43.960 --> 28:44.900
that a promise is more important

28:44.920 --> 28:45.730
than a life.

28:46.510 --> 28:47.530
As you yourself once said,

28:47.920 --> 28:48.660
if an assassin doesn't

28:49.160 --> 28:49.980
honor their promises,

28:50.070 --> 28:51.220
they can kill their patron

28:51.270 --> 28:53.050
for richer pay.

28:53.720 --> 28:55.180
In the end, order will collapse.

28:56.400 --> 28:57.900
Assassins will lose their reason to exist.

28:58.160 --> 28:59.700
And Blood River will also fall apart.

29:03.750 --> 29:04.530
You are clever,

29:05.750 --> 29:07.420
but sometimes too stubborn.

29:09.590 --> 29:11.010
I'm already a pawn for killing.

29:12.310 --> 29:14.010
If I don't hold onto certain beliefs,

29:14.680 --> 29:15.290
living will feel

29:16.830 --> 29:17.810
no different from dying.

29:24.200 --> 29:24.700
Sir,

29:26.590 --> 29:27.140
you have lost.

29:29.830 --> 29:30.330
Farewell.

29:38.200 --> 29:38.660
Yu,

29:39.440 --> 29:40.140
you will never win.

29:41.510 --> 29:42.810
The heads of the Three Families have coveted

29:42.880 --> 29:43.900
the Patriarch's seat for years.

29:44.400 --> 29:44.810
They will not

29:44.880 --> 29:45.770
let this opportunity pass.

29:46.310 --> 29:47.220
Even if the Patriarch

29:47.240 --> 29:48.180
recovers,

29:48.270 --> 29:48.860
they will

29:48.960 --> 29:50.180
stop at nothing to kill him.

29:50.270 --> 29:51.490
You're fighting a losing battle.

29:51.920 --> 29:52.810
If so,

29:54.440 --> 29:54.900
what is Changhe

29:54.960 --> 29:56.050
trying to do?

29:56.200 --> 29:57.420
He wants to change Blood River.

30:00.110 --> 30:01.050
Cross the "blood river,"

30:02.240 --> 30:03.250
and we will reach the other shore.

30:05.400 --> 30:06.180
On that shore,

30:06.440 --> 30:07.380
there will be no more darkness.

30:08.200 --> 30:08.900
Instead,

30:10.160 --> 30:10.730
light will prevail.

30:13.350 --> 30:14.250
Join us.

30:15.030 --> 30:15.940
Changhe plans

30:16.240 --> 30:17.180
to have the Patriarch die

30:17.240 --> 30:18.330
at the right time

30:18.640 --> 30:19.860
and pass the Dormant Dragon Sword to you

30:19.960 --> 30:20.490
before he dies.

30:20.640 --> 30:21.490
You will command Blood River,

30:21.920 --> 30:22.770
while he will

30:22.790 --> 30:23.460
clear the obstacles

30:23.510 --> 30:24.490
and become its new head.

30:24.960 --> 30:26.140
Then, if the other two families

30:26.240 --> 30:27.090
resist,

30:28.000 --> 30:29.730
you two will join hands to purge Blood River.

30:32.680 --> 30:33.090
Yu?

30:33.880 --> 30:34.250
Sorry.

30:35.720 --> 30:36.570
I've made my choice.

30:42.240 --> 30:42.860
Changhe said it.

30:43.440 --> 30:44.140
If you don't cooperate,

30:44.310 --> 30:45.010
he will make himself

30:45.070 --> 30:46.050
the Patriarch.

30:46.400 --> 30:47.010
When he does,

30:47.030 --> 30:47.860
he will kill

30:47.880 --> 30:48.900
whoever stands in his way,

30:50.110 --> 30:50.770
including you,

30:53.640 --> 30:55.180
the dearest friend he's ever had.

31:05.790 --> 31:06.330
Muyu,

31:07.920 --> 31:09.140
the road will be long and perilous.

31:11.000 --> 31:11.530
Walk,

31:12.070 --> 31:12.810
and I shall reach the destination.

31:19.750 --> 31:22.810
You intend to get poisoned before finding

31:23.440 --> 31:24.660
the antidote?

31:26.000 --> 31:26.770
I must say,

31:26.960 --> 31:29.090
that's really bold.

31:30.440 --> 31:32.050
There's one thing I don't understand, though.

31:32.880 --> 31:34.250
Would you really risk your life

31:35.240 --> 31:38.050
for a few silver notes?

31:41.200 --> 31:42.420
Of course not.

31:42.510 --> 31:43.220
I'm not a fool.

31:44.790 --> 31:46.330
But I know a way

31:46.880 --> 31:48.570
to feel

31:48.830 --> 31:50.530
the poison in you just as you do

31:50.920 --> 31:52.010
while keeping myself alive.

31:52.830 --> 31:53.770
And what is that?

31:56.000 --> 31:57.090
The Soul-Swap Technique.

32:03.310 --> 32:04.810
Medicine King Valley's secret technique,

32:04.880 --> 32:06.330
the Soul-Swap Technique.

32:08.000 --> 32:08.810
But

32:09.270 --> 32:10.810
with this technique,

32:11.640 --> 32:13.460
the target's five senses,

32:14.750 --> 32:16.730
their past, and their present thoughts

32:17.790 --> 32:18.900
are shared

32:19.270 --> 32:20.620
with the practitioner.

32:21.830 --> 32:23.460
If the target's will is weak,

32:23.750 --> 32:25.050
their mind may even

32:25.160 --> 32:25.980
be seized entirely.

32:28.590 --> 32:30.460
When I first learned of it,

32:30.830 --> 32:31.980
I thought:

32:32.550 --> 32:33.860
this is no medicine;

32:34.960 --> 32:36.490
it is sorcery.

32:40.400 --> 32:40.940
True.

32:42.640 --> 32:43.700
A physician

32:44.240 --> 32:45.770
treats the body's ailments,

32:46.440 --> 32:47.380
but the Soul-Swap Technique

32:47.510 --> 32:48.570
can heal the mind.

32:49.510 --> 32:50.700
However, my aim with you

32:50.750 --> 32:51.940
is to purge you completely

32:52.350 --> 32:53.940
of the toxins

32:53.960 --> 32:54.940
using this technique.

32:55.640 --> 32:56.860
As for the thoughts

32:56.920 --> 32:58.290
you have,

32:59.070 --> 33:00.180
I will try to ignore them.

33:04.750 --> 33:05.730
If you

33:06.720 --> 33:08.860
use this technique,

33:09.030 --> 33:10.490
then my life...

33:13.240 --> 33:14.620
Naturally, it will be

33:14.680 --> 33:16.620
entirely under my control.

33:17.510 --> 33:18.460
At any moment I wish,

33:18.830 --> 33:20.620
I could end your life.

33:30.510 --> 33:31.620
I will try it.

33:32.830 --> 33:34.330
Let the Patriarch

33:34.400 --> 33:35.460
live as long as he can.

33:35.680 --> 33:36.180
Our priority now

33:36.440 --> 33:37.810
is to hurry and find a chance

33:38.070 --> 33:38.770
to kill

33:38.920 --> 33:39.810
that young miracle physician.

33:42.270 --> 33:44.050
The Patriarch and that physician

33:44.440 --> 33:46.050
are protected by the Twelve Zodiacs.

33:46.550 --> 33:47.420
Why do you seem so confident?

33:51.000 --> 33:52.380
I had a letter sent

33:52.920 --> 33:54.330
to the imperial city in the north.

33:54.960 --> 33:56.380
A man there was born of the Tang Clan,

33:56.440 --> 33:57.140
famed and renowned.

33:57.720 --> 33:58.570
He's Second Master Tang's

33:58.640 --> 33:59.730
closest disciple.

34:00.440 --> 34:01.530
In the Pipa Pavilion of Jiujiang,

34:01.720 --> 34:03.570
with three hidden weapons, he stunned the world.

34:04.440 --> 34:06.140
He is a martial arts expert on par

34:06.270 --> 34:07.380
with Sikong Changfeng

34:07.680 --> 34:08.690
and Baili Dongjun.

34:10.070 --> 34:10.980
Tang Lianyue?

34:15.220 --> 34:16.920
[Tang Lianyue of the Tang Clan]

34:16.920 --> 34:17.460
I don't know

34:17.510 --> 34:19.460
why the Patriarch killed Second Master Tang.

34:20.190 --> 34:20.780
But I know

34:20.840 --> 34:21.780
Tang Lianyue would be

34:22.550 --> 34:23.900
the one most driven

34:25.000 --> 34:26.090
to avenge Second Master Tang.

34:55.030 --> 34:56.130
Escort the Patriarch away.

34:57.230 --> 34:57.570
Hurry!

34:57.800 --> 34:58.300
- Understood. - Understood.

35:06.110 --> 35:07.210
We barely had time to catch our breath,

35:08.000 --> 35:09.050
and now we are on the run again.

35:10.590 --> 35:11.980
Once you heal me,

35:12.710 --> 35:14.420
no one will dare come after us.

35:35.190 --> 35:36.010
Found you,

35:37.320 --> 35:38.170
Blood River.

35:51.400 --> 35:52.050
Dragon Beard Needles?

35:52.630 --> 35:53.570
You're from the Tang Clan.

35:54.000 --> 35:54.530
Tang Lianyue

35:55.150 --> 35:55.980
of the Tang Clan.

35:56.360 --> 35:57.420
Tang Lianyue?

35:58.400 --> 35:59.090
I see.

35:59.880 --> 36:01.820
You are the Xuanwu Guardian, one of Tianqi City's

36:01.920 --> 36:02.740
Four Guardians.

36:03.550 --> 36:04.740
You are not the one I seek.

36:05.670 --> 36:07.010
Where is your Patriarch?

36:07.400 --> 36:08.090
I need to see him.

36:08.840 --> 36:10.340
Even if you are the Xuanwu Guardian,

36:12.190 --> 36:13.980
for one, we are not in Tianqi City,

36:15.000 --> 36:15.610
and for another,

36:15.880 --> 36:16.860
Blood River

36:17.400 --> 36:18.860
answers to no imperial orders.

36:19.400 --> 36:21.130
The Patriarch is not someone you can

36:21.590 --> 36:22.260
demand to meet.

36:22.880 --> 36:24.340
I didn't come

36:24.360 --> 36:25.860
as Tianqi City's Xuanwu Guardian.

36:26.710 --> 36:28.740
I came as a disciple of the Tang Clan.

36:29.480 --> 36:30.650
Your Patriarch

36:31.400 --> 36:33.050
killed our second master.

36:33.360 --> 36:34.090
I have come

36:34.670 --> 36:36.050
to settle that score.

36:37.280 --> 36:38.170
How did you

36:38.440 --> 36:39.780
learn about this?

36:40.230 --> 36:41.980
What if it's

36:42.400 --> 36:43.260
all a rumor?

36:44.440 --> 36:45.610
I suppose your Patriarch

36:45.670 --> 36:46.490
left long ago,

36:46.920 --> 36:48.300
leaving you behind to cover the retreat.

36:48.960 --> 36:49.860
All this talk

36:50.590 --> 36:52.130
is just to stall for time.

36:53.360 --> 36:53.940
You're not leaving.

37:05.280 --> 37:05.650
Rise!

37:10.440 --> 37:11.740
What a masterful command of hidden weapons.

37:12.230 --> 37:13.820
Is this the skill of a top-ranked master

37:13.880 --> 37:15.090
on Baixiao Hall's Roll of Legends?

37:18.880 --> 37:20.610
Fiery Paper Butterflies and Netherworld Spiders?

37:21.070 --> 37:22.210
You are the Spider Woman

37:22.800 --> 37:23.690
of Blood River's Mu family.

37:24.190 --> 37:25.380
I don't like that code name.

37:26.320 --> 37:26.980
What a petty trick.

37:27.710 --> 37:28.980
Did you think I wouldn't notice

37:29.030 --> 37:29.610
you using

37:30.000 --> 37:31.690
Fiery Paper Butterflies as cover

37:32.070 --> 37:33.130
to let Netherworld Spiders

37:33.670 --> 37:34.980
sneak up and ambush me?

37:36.510 --> 37:38.260
You think you're clever, but you're a fool.

37:42.480 --> 37:43.690
What did you put inside the Netherworld Spiders?

37:44.280 --> 37:45.170
Naturally, Thunder Orbs

37:45.280 --> 37:46.530
from the Lei family of Thunder Hall.

37:47.000 --> 37:47.570
How did you

37:47.670 --> 37:48.860
get those?

37:50.070 --> 37:50.940
Years ago, when I passed

37:51.000 --> 37:52.010
by Thunder Hall on a mission,

37:52.480 --> 37:54.010
quite a few young men

37:54.480 --> 37:55.420
from the Lei family

37:55.480 --> 37:56.610
fell head over heels for me.

37:57.800 --> 37:59.650
Of course, they offered them up with both hands

38:00.360 --> 38:01.170
to please me.

38:03.630 --> 38:04.380
Anyway,

38:05.480 --> 38:06.980
why am I even telling you this?

38:46.280 --> 38:49.610
♪A son need never learn to read♪

38:49.800 --> 38:52.900
♪Cockfights and horse races serve him better indeed♪

38:53.510 --> 38:56.690
♪The Jia boy, only thirteen years old♪

38:57.230 --> 39:00.340
♪Has more wealth than most nobles♪

39:01.030 --> 39:03.900
♪He calls the bets and wins with pride♪

39:04.510 --> 39:07.690
♪In silken white, with a gilded carriage by his side♪

39:08.280 --> 39:11.420
♪His father lies dead far away from Chang'an...♪

39:11.710 --> 39:12.530
When the children light the lamps,

39:14.030 --> 39:15.170
the ghosts come to claim lives.

39:16.550 --> 39:17.860
Do you remember

39:18.550 --> 39:19.900
that back in the day,

39:22.550 --> 39:25.260
you nearly became one of these Lamp Children as well?

39:41.230 --> 39:42.490
Mu Yinzhen of the Mu family.

39:43.380 --> 39:46.340
[Mu Yinzhen of the Mu family]

39:46.360 --> 39:47.570
You dare fight me?

39:48.510 --> 39:50.260
Do you mean to betray Blood River?

39:52.000 --> 39:52.490
Interesting.

39:53.440 --> 39:54.940
The reports I received

39:56.110 --> 39:57.980
say you plotted against the Patriarch

39:58.590 --> 39:59.820
and planned to rebel.

40:00.920 --> 40:02.010
I came to kill you

40:02.920 --> 40:04.300
on my family's orders,

40:05.320 --> 40:07.050
to rescue the Patriarch.

40:11.840 --> 40:12.460
It seems

40:12.510 --> 40:14.050
the Mu family is truly loyal.

40:29.360 --> 40:32.980
I have long heard that Su Muyu, the Umbrella Ghost,

40:33.440 --> 40:34.740
is famed

40:35.760 --> 40:37.650
for his Eighteen-Sword Array.

40:39.320 --> 40:41.740
Yet looking at your stance now,

40:43.030 --> 40:44.300
you seem to think

40:45.190 --> 40:46.340
I don't deserve

40:47.070 --> 40:47.940
to see

40:48.000 --> 40:49.610
your 18 blades all at once.

40:50.960 --> 40:52.210
You don't.

41:04.480 --> 41:06.380
It should've been you back then,

41:07.190 --> 41:08.650
but Su Changhe took your place

41:08.800 --> 41:10.420
as a Lamp Child.

41:11.840 --> 41:13.130
According to my plan,

41:13.590 --> 41:15.340
they should've all died,

41:16.000 --> 41:16.900
yet he

41:17.550 --> 41:19.210
was saved by you.

41:28.360 --> 41:29.260
I think I see now

41:29.320 --> 41:31.010
why he stood in for you.

41:33.590 --> 41:35.940
Had you been one of the Lamp Children,

41:38.150 --> 41:39.900
you would've surely died.

41:40.840 --> 41:42.300
I never expected

41:42.840 --> 41:45.380
the Su family's famed Umbrella Ghost,

41:45.880 --> 41:47.490
the Nameless who crawled

41:47.550 --> 41:49.050
from the corpse-strewn Furnace,

41:50.920 --> 41:53.010
the current Kui, and the leader of the Spider Shadow,

41:53.400 --> 41:54.570
to be a man

41:55.000 --> 41:56.530
with a merciful heart

41:57.400 --> 41:59.300
who cannot strike a child.

42:31.880 --> 42:32.690
Your sword

42:34.440 --> 42:36.010
is not as swift as I imagined.

42:40.630 --> 42:41.170
Is that so?

42:50.190 --> 42:50.860
Impossible.

42:53.400 --> 42:55.170
I clearly blocked that strike.

42:56.030 --> 42:56.460
There are few

42:56.550 --> 42:57.980
I truly wish to kill in this world,

42:59.230 --> 42:59.980
but sadly,

43:01.670 --> 43:03.050
you are one of them.

43:40.480 --> 43:40.980
Don't be afraid.

43:47.070 --> 43:47.780
Find a place

43:49.110 --> 43:50.300
and hide with your companions.

43:51.670 --> 43:52.340
This conflict

43:54.230 --> 43:55.340
will probably last a long time.

44:10.280 --> 44:11.980
It seems the Xuanwu Guardian of Tianqi City

44:12.710 --> 44:13.940
is not so hard to deal with after all.

44:18.550 --> 44:20.420
Our Tang Clan does not fear the Lei Fortress.

44:21.230 --> 44:21.900
Likewise,

44:22.590 --> 44:24.170
I'm not afraid of your Thunder Orbs either.

44:28.320 --> 44:29.010
Move again,

44:29.920 --> 44:31.170
and I will have no choice but to kill you.

44:40.760 --> 44:43.090
I heard there was once the blood of a prince

44:43.760 --> 44:45.260
on your Fingertip Blade.

44:46.920 --> 44:48.650
Why are you now

44:49.000 --> 44:50.380
so hesitant to kill?

44:51.280 --> 44:52.260
I don't wish to kill,

44:53.230 --> 44:54.690
even if you are from Blood River.

44:56.960 --> 44:57.860
I thought

44:58.400 --> 45:00.340
it was your love of beauty

45:01.150 --> 45:02.260
that held you back.

45:07.230 --> 45:08.050
Silly.

45:19.800 --> 45:21.460
I've long heard that the Mu family of Blood River

45:21.760 --> 45:22.980
excels in trickery.

45:23.480 --> 45:24.170
Today I see

45:24.760 --> 45:25.530
that it is true.

45:26.150 --> 45:27.610
In the Pipa Pavilion of Jiujiang,

45:28.320 --> 45:29.650
you, Tang Lianyue of the Tang Clan,

45:30.510 --> 45:32.650
became famed across the land with three hidden weapons.

45:33.030 --> 45:34.340
I have

45:34.670 --> 45:36.050
long admired you as well.

45:36.630 --> 45:38.210
I shouldn't have shown you mercy earlier.

45:38.920 --> 45:39.940
Now I'm caught in your bewitching spell.

45:40.590 --> 45:41.260
Bewitching spell?

45:43.360 --> 45:44.170
What do you mean?

45:45.190 --> 45:46.010
You know

45:46.710 --> 45:48.090
I rose to fame in Jiujiang's Pipa Pavilion

45:48.710 --> 45:50.490
with three hidden weapons,

45:51.320 --> 45:52.340
but do you know

45:53.400 --> 45:55.260
which three they are?

45:56.480 --> 45:58.170
Rumor says

45:59.000 --> 46:02.380
you forged all three yourself.

46:03.400 --> 46:04.780
But I haven't heard

46:05.840 --> 46:06.820
what they are exactly.

46:07.590 --> 46:08.420
No need to know beforehand.

46:08.920 --> 46:10.300
You will see them soon enough.

46:11.230 --> 46:11.740
Don't move.

46:13.630 --> 46:14.170
If you move again,

46:15.670 --> 46:16.860
my spiders

46:17.550 --> 46:18.650
will turn you

46:18.710 --> 46:19.340
into an ice statue.

46:20.320 --> 46:21.780
If I add in a few Netherworld Spiders,

46:22.760 --> 46:23.940
you will be blown

46:24.110 --> 46:25.090
to nothing.

46:25.920 --> 46:26.980
I'd like to see you try.

46:43.880 --> 46:44.780
This is the first

46:44.800 --> 46:46.340
of those three hidden weapons,

46:47.280 --> 46:48.570
Cries of 1,000 Birds!

46:52.820 --> 46:56.300
♪Like fate, winding with the tide♪

46:56.340 --> 47:00.220
♪Who can ford this river of night?♪

47:02.220 --> 47:05.780
♪Where's the far shore we chase all our lives?♪

